---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { BRAND_CONFIG } from '../config/brand.config';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy & Consent Mode v2 | BidWise Marketing"
  description="How BidWise Marketing uses cookies and Google Consent Mode v2 to respect user privacy and measure website performance."
>
  <div class="legal-page-section section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="glass-card legal-card">
        <h1 class="legal-title">Cookie Policy &amp; Telemetry</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last Updated: February 2026</p>

        <div class="legal-content">
          <h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
          <p>
            Cookies are small text files stored on your computer or mobile device when you browse websites. They help websites remember preferences, analyze performance, and ensure secure authentication.
          </p>

          <h2>2. How BidWise Marketing Implements Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            We adhere strictly to transparent data privacy standards and applicable US data protection regulations (including CCPA/CPRA). Non-essential cookies and tracking scripts are managed responsibly through our cookie preferences banner.
          </p>

          <h2>3. Categories of Cookies Used</h2>
          
          <h3>A. Strictly Necessary Cookies</h3>
          <p>
            These cookies are indispensable for website navigation and security. They do not store personally identifiable data and cannot be disabled in our systems.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><code>bidwise_consent</code>: Stores your cookie consent preferences (valid for 12 months).</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>B. Performance &amp; Analytical Cookies (Optional)</h3>
          <p>
            These cookies allow us to count visits and traffic sources so we can measure and improve the performance of our site. We implement <strong>Google Consent Mode v2</strong>, ensuring cookieless pings and privacy-compliant modeling when consent is withheld.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_*</code>: Google Analytics 4 cookies used to calculate visitor and session statistics.</li>
            <li>Google Tag Manager: Facilitates tag firing strictly according to your selected consent parameters.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>4. Managing Your Preferences</h2>
          <p>
            You can change or withdraw your cookie consent at any time by clearing your browser cookies and reloading the site to re-open our consent manager. You may also block cookies through your browser settings.
          </p>

          <h2>5. Contact &amp; Questions</h2>
          <p>
            For questions regarding our cookie telemetry practices, contact us at: <a href={`mailto:${BRAND_CONFIG.contact.email}`} class="text-cyan">{BRAND_CONFIG.contact.email}</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page-section {
    padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + 50px);
  }

  .legal-card {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px;
    background: rgba(8, 22, 38, 0.8);
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 32px 0 12px 0;
  }

  .legal-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--cyan-bright);
    margin: 20px 0 8px 0;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    margin: 12px 0 20px 24px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .legal-content li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .legal-content code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--cyan-primary);
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-card {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
